            "review_title": "Review at Ah!Ngon Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Elizabeth Tran\n5 contributions\n0\nFood is so delicious, you should try it !\nNov 2018 • Friends\nIf you want to eat hotpot, you should go to Ah!Ngon Deli (Ah!Ngon Quán). This place have a lot of hotpot that you can choice. Such as : mushroom hotpot, tomyum hotpot, mushroom with chicken hotpot, lemon string hotpot, seafood hotpot, sour spicy beef hotpot, raw beef dipped with enokitake, stir-fried spicy cheese hotpot , tomyum red tilapia hotpot, chicken hotpot with cinnamon, shrimp hotpot , mixed hotpot,...\n\nI choice mushroom hotpot after I find out it on internet. I see that having many good comment for it. Actually, mushroom hotpot is so delicious with beef, shrimp, clam & very kind of mushroom. \n\nBeside of hotpot, Ah Ngon Deli also have many fast food that is very delicious. You should try it. Such as : beef salad, raw beef salad with lemon, sour spicy seafood salad,... tomyum grilled squid, grilled shrimp with salt, chilli,..\n\nServer is nice, deli space is warm, small & nice. Price is cheap :D :D :D \n\nI like this Ah Ngon Deli , I will come back in my birthday :D :D :D\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 14, 2018",
